;                            28 -> 0.466667 (= length; the fighter is idle again)
; Pivot rotation (rad):  85 deg wind-back start, 100 deg wound back, 70 deg sweep starts, -15 deg at
; the hitbox, -20 deg settled. Transitions: 0.5 ease-out into the wind-back, 2.0 ease-in (accelerating)
; into the active frames, 1.0 linear sweep, 0.4 ease-out settling through recovery.

